DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nHigh Line Comedy Cl
	ub brings together top stand-up comedians and a one-of-a-kind mini-golf ex
	perience under one roof on Manhattan’s West Side. Featuring comics seen on
	 Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\, The Tonight Show\, The Late Show\, and T
	he Daily Show\, this is NYC’s most unique comedy night out. \nTucked insid
	e an immersive mini-golf venue\, High Line Comedy Club is a hidden gem in 
	the city’s comedy scene — combining rooftop views\, a fantastic food menu\
	, and high-energy live performances night after night. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: July 10\, 2026 and ongoing (select dates during purchase)\nTime: 7:00 
	PM and 9:00 PM show times available\nVenue: High Line Comedy Club\nAddress
	: 446 West 14th Street\, New York\, NY 10014\nCity: New York\, NY\nPrice: 
	From $26.00 (Early Bird)\; $35.00 General Admission\nAge Restriction: 21+ 
	only \nAbout the Venue\nHigh Line Comedy Club is a premier stand-up venue 
	located at 446 W 14th St in Manhattan’s Meatpacking District. Set inside a
	n immersive mini-golf venue\, it offers rooftop views\, a full food and dr
	ink menu\, and an intimate atmosphere that makes every show feel special. 
	A one-item food or drink purchase minimum is required. \nWhat to Expect\nE
	njoy a full stand-up comedy showcase featuring both established headliners
	 and rising stars\, followed by a round of mini-golf. The club’s vibrant a
	tmosphere and rotating lineup ensure a fresh\, high-energy experience ever
	y visit. \nThis is the perfect date night or group outing — laughs\, drink
	s\, food\, and mini-golf all in one unforgettable evening in NYC. \nTicket
	 Information\nTickets are available through Fever. Early Bird tickets star
	t at $26.00\; General Admission is $35.00. Age 21+ strictly enforced. Sele
	ct your preferred date and show time during purchase. \nGet Tickets\n\nhtt
	ps://comedycalendar.com/event/comedy-show-and-mini-golf-experience-live-at
	-high-line-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
