SUMMARY:Jimmy Carr: Laughs Funny LIVE at Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas
DTSTAMP:20260710T043049Z
DTSTART:20260710T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nJimmy Carr is one of the most distinctive and fearless comedians in t
	he world — a British stand-up legend known for his razor-sharp wit\, light
	ning-fast delivery\, and his willingness to go places other comedians simp
	ly won’t. With a career spanning over two decades\, Jimmy has become one o
	f the most successful touring comedians on the planet\, selling out arenas
	 across the UK\, Europe\, and North America. \nKnown for his dark\, intell
	igent humor and his mastery of the one-liner format\, Jimmy Carr’s Laughs 
	Funny tour is his latest all-new stand-up show — packed with the kind of s
	harp\, provocative comedy that has made him a global phenomenon. His Netfl
	ix specials\, including His Dark Material and Terribly Funny\, have introd
	uced his comedy to millions of new fans worldwide. \nDue to overwhelming d
	emand\, Jimmy has added a second night at the Encore Theater — July 10 and
	 11 — making this a rare two-night Las Vegas engagement from one of comedy
	’s biggest international stars. \nEvent Details\n\nDates: Friday\, July 10
	 & Saturday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM\nVenue: Encore Theater at Wynn
	 Las Vegas\nAddress: 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, NV 89109\n\nAbout
	 the Venue\nThe Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas is one of the most intima
	te and prestigious entertainment venues on the Las Vegas Strip. Located in
	side the luxurious Wynn Las Vegas resort at 3121 S Las Vegas Blvd\, the En
	core Theater seats approximately 1\,600 guests and is celebrated for its e
	xceptional acoustics\, elegant design\, and the up-close\, personal atmosp
	here it creates for every performance. \nThe Encore Theater has hosted som
	e of the biggest names in comedy and entertainment\, including Sebastian M
	aniscalco\, Jerry Seinfeld\, and now Jimmy Carr. Its intimate layout ensur
	es that every seat feels close to the stage\, making it one of the best ve
	nues in Las Vegas for a stand-up comedy show. \nValet and self-parking are
	 available at Wynn Las Vegas. The resort offers world-class dining\, shopp
	ing\, and casino entertainment\, making it easy to turn a Jimmy Carr show 
	into a full luxury Las Vegas evening. \nWhat to Expect\nThis is a solo sta
	nd-up performance by Jimmy Carr featuring all-new material from his Laughs
	 Funny tour. The show runs approximately 90 minutes and features Jimmy’s s
	ignature rapid-fire delivery\, dark wit\, and the kind of fearless\, bound
	ary-pushing comedy that has made him one of the most talked-about comedian
	s in the world. \nJimmy Carr’s live shows are known for their electric atm
	osphere and the sense that anything could happen — his comedy is sharp\, s
	urprising\, and relentlessly funny. Whether you’re a longtime fan or seein
	g him for the first time\, this is a show that will leave you breathless w
	ith laughter. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $90 – $500+ \nTickets ava
	ilable through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). Both night
	s are expected to sell out — grab your seats now! \nOfficial TicketsResale
	 Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jimmy-carr-laughs-funny-encor
	e-theater-wynn-las-vegas-july/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jimmy-carr-laughs-funny-encore-theater
	-wynn-las-vegas-july/
LOCATION:Encore Theater at Wynn Las Vegas\, 3131 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Veg
	as\, NV\, 89109\, USA
