	t \nDoors Open: 8:00 PM | Show Starts: 8:30 PM \nDuration: Approximately 9
	0 minutes \nAge Requirement: 21+ \nAccessibility: The venue is wheelchair 
	accessible. \nAbout the Venue\nBar Lubitsch is an intimate bar and event s
	pace located at 7702 Santa Monica Boulevard in West Hollywood\, California
	. The cozy setting makes it the perfect backdrop for an up-close comedy ex
	perience. \nThe small venue format is part of what makes Jetpack Comedy sp
	ecial — audiences get to experience world-class comedians in a setting tha
	t feels personal and electric. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a high-energy nigh
	t of stand-up comedy featuring nationally recognized headliners and surpri
	se guests. Jetpack Comedy has been running for over ten years and consiste
	ntly delivers top-tier performances. \nThe intimate atmosphere means you’r
	e never far from the action. Come ready to laugh — and maybe spot your fav
	orite comedian from TV or streaming. \nTicket Information\nGeneral Admissi
	on tickets are $20.00. No booking fees apply. Tickets are available throug
	h Fever. \nGet Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/jetpack-comedy-
	big-comics-small-venue-live-at-bar-lubitsch/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/jetpack-comedy-big-comics-small-venue-
	live-at-bar-lubitsch/
