SUMMARY:Thank Comedy Its Friday Late Night Stand Up Show LIVE at The Comic 
	Strip
DTSTAMP:20260710T043049Z
DTSTART:20260710T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We may earn a commission at
	 no extra cost to you. \nGet Tickets \nAbout the Show\nKick off the weeken
	d the right way at the iconic Comic Strip Live with “Thank Comedy It’s Fri
	day” — New York City’s premier late-night stand-up comedy show. Featuring 
	hilarious sets from top comedians seen on Netflix\, HBO\, Comedy Central\,
	 BET\, and viral social media platforms\, this is the perfect way to shake
	 off the week. \nDJ E.M. provides a live show soundtrack to keep the energ
	y high all night long. Bring your friends\, grab a drink\, and enjoy an ev
	ening packed with jokes\, good vibes\, and great company. \nEvent Details\
	nDate: Every Friday Night (July 10 – August 7\, 2026)\nTime: Doors open at
	 10:00 PM\; Showtime starts at 10:30 PM\nVenue: The Comic Strip (Comic Str
	ip Live)\nAddress: 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\nCity: New York\,
	 NY\nPrice: $25.00 General Admission\nAge Restriction: 21+ with valid ID\n
	Note: Two-item minimum purchase per person required \nAbout the Venue\nThe
	 Comic Strip is one of New York City’s most iconic comedy clubs\, located 
	at 1568 2nd Avenue on the Upper East Side. A legendary launching pad for c
	ountless comedy careers\, this intimate venue has hosted some of the bigge
	st names in stand-up. Accessible via the 77th St (6 train) and 86th St (Q 
	train) subway stations. \nWhat to Expect\nExpect a high-energy late-night 
	comedy experience with a rotating lineup of top-tier talent from Netflix a
	nd Comedy Central. The live DJ soundtrack keeps the atmosphere electric fr
	om the moment you walk in until the last punchline lands. \nThis is the ul
	timate Friday night out in NYC — laughs\, drinks\, and great vibes at one 
	of the city’s most storied comedy venues. \nTicket Information\nTickets ar
	e available through Fever. General Admission is $25.00. Must be 21+ with v
	alid ID. A two-item minimum purchase per person is required at the event. 
	Available every Friday night through August 7\, 2026. \nGet Tickets\n\nhtt
	ps://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-stand-up-
	show-live-at-the-comic-strip/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/thank-comedy-its-friday-late-night-sta
	nd-up-show-live-at-the-comic-strip/
LOCATION:The Comic Strip\, 1568 2nd Avenue\, New York\, NY 10028\, New York
	\, NY\, 10028\, United States
