DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nDC Young Fly LIVE at Goodyear Theater\nGet ready f
	or a night of non-stop laughs as DC Young Fly takes the stage at the iconi
	c Goodyear Theater in Akron\, Ohio! Known for his explosive energy\, hilar
	ious storytelling\, and viral social media presence\, DC Young Fly deliver
	s a stand-up experience you won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDate: Sat
	urday\, July 11\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM EDT (Doors open at 7:00 PM)\nVenue: 
	Goodyear Theater\nAddress: 1201 East Market Street\, Akron\, OH 44305\nAge
	 Requirement: 18+ Event\nParking: Available at nearby lots and parking dec
	ks \nAbout DC Young Fly\nDC Young Fly (John Whitfield) is an Atlanta-born 
	comedian\, actor\, and social media sensation who rose to fame through hil
	arious Vine and Instagram videos. He is best known for his appearances on 
	MTV’s Wild ‘N Out and has starred in films including Almost Christmas and 
	How High 2. His raw\, energetic stand-up style has earned him a massive fo
	llowing and sold-out shows across the country. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-en
	ergy stand-up comedy from one of social media’s biggest stars\nHilarious s
	torytelling rooted in real-life experiences\nCrowd interaction and improvi
	sed moments\nA night of non-stop laughter in an intimate theater setting\n
	An unforgettable live performance from a fan-favorite comedian\n\nVenue In
	formation\nThe Goodyear Theater is a beloved entertainment venue located a
	t 1201 East Market Street in Akron\, Ohio. With a capacity that creates an
	 intimate atmosphere\, the theater offers excellent sightlines and a vibra
	nt setting for live comedy and entertainment events. \nTicket Information\
	nTickets start at $94. This is an 18+ event — valid photo ID required for 
	entry. Tickets are available through Ticketmaster (official) or VividSeats
	 (resale marketplace). \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post cont
	ains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through
	 our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subj
	ect to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedy
	calendar.com/event/dc-young-fly-live-at-goodyear-theater/\n\nFrom Comedy C
	alendar
