	: IP Casino Resort and Spa (Studio A)\nAddress: 850 Bayview Ave\, Biloxi\,
	 MS 39530\nPhone: (228) 436-3000 \nAbout Danae Hays\nDanae Hays is a viral
	 comedian and social media star whose hilarious videos about Southern life
	\, country culture\, and everyday absurdity have earned her millions of fa
	ns. Her authentic\, high-energy style translates perfectly to the live sta
	ge\, making every show an unforgettable experience full of big laughs and 
	Southern charm. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHigh-energy stand-up comedy with Danae
	 Hays’ signature country flair\nHilarious material from The BUCKWILD Tour\
	nA rowdy\, fun Saturday night atmosphere on the Gulf Coast\nLive performan
	ce from one of social media’s most beloved comedians\nGreat entertainment 
	at the IP Casino Resort and Spa in Biloxi\n\nVenue Information\nIP Casino 
	Resort and Spa is located at 850 Bayview Ave in Biloxi\, MS\, offering a f
	ull resort experience with casino gaming\, dining\, and a premier entertai
	nment venue right on the Gulf Coast. \nTicket Information\nTickets start f
	rom $75. Grab your seats now before this show sells out! \nOfficial Ticket
